674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rZnboqmW6xoQ7kNvwFRaxrS&_nc_oc=AdoWgpfzrny9owoeU6LTnDqbZq5nBDdFYLRUfcC3QUk9T_TX_O4MgpS13WcWYmXeIds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af17i6YRqqvj9SIzztDD1TmZg8nbOZCOv2GzqVwdLI7J9Q&oe=69E78A59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sDq8tvuDotgQ7kNvwFQE4Sh&_nc_oc=Adpb0RiAfBiNviqOn_9rRwjsZF3g1yJ_bFzG5b56s3It3-Hk6-S9O-dx05ycl1rvS_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2uBclKmRmhik-F4lCp-kcCqa-OUpjJFnDOblCtCAbhaA&oe=69E75AD6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7hiJlvpIVIkQ7kNvwF-tKvA&_nc_oc=AdruVSYly9b-0wyz-vrq4S5QmLcJ4xfB_qxBUWhoAfdjd6kpYc52LhvkHc9QEpk7ijc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2WN9bkEwgaahMG3vpMcsJAtkMsm2kplHc_x5b91CrpCg&oe=69E78F31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip